க்கவும்","status":"draft","note":"Draft for emptying typed input. Use the project glossary for the exact field name. Deleting an existing record is a different action.","source":{"id":"reference-only","url":"https://ta.wiktionary.org/wiki/%E0%AE%85%E0%AE%B4%E0%AE%BF"}},{"locale":"ta","script":"Taml","concept":"crm.sales_leads","role":"navigation-label","text":"சாத்தியமான வாடிக்கையாளர்கள்","status":"draft","note":"Descriptive draft for the CRM noun meaning potential customers. Check the product's definition and the audience's familiarity with CRM terms.","source":{"id":"reference-only","url":"https://help.zoho.com/portal/en/kb/crm/sales-force-automation/leads/articles/leads-26-4-2026"}},{"locale":"ta","script":"Taml","concept":"auth.create_account","role":"button","text":"கணக்கை உருவாக்கு","status":"draft","note":"Unreviewed draft for creating a new account. The linked file is Telegram's English \"Sign Up\", which this Tamil phrase is not taken from. Not a native-speaker review.","source":{"id":"reference-only","url":"https://github.com/DrKLO/Telegram/blob/21f7d109da6ab3506c9e9577f98c6a38771ab335/TMessagesProj/src/main/res/values/strings.xml"}},{"locale":"ta","script":"Taml","concept":"auth.change_password","role":"button","text":"கடவுச்சொல்லை மாற்று","status":"draft","note":"Unreviewed draft for changing the password while signed in. Password recovery is auth.reset_password. Not source-attested.","source":{"id":"reference-only","url":"https://github.com/DrKLO/Telegram/blob/21f7d109da6ab3506c9e9577f98c6a38771ab335/TMessagesProj/src/main/res/values/strings.xml"}},{"locale":"ta","script":"Taml","concept":"auth.reset_password","role":"link","text":"கடவுச்சொல்லை மறந்துவிட்டீர்களா?","status":"draft","note":"Unreviewed draft for starting password recovery. It does not mean the password has already changed.","source":{"id":"reference-only","url":"https://github.com/DrKLO/Telegram/blob/21f7d109da6ab3506c9e9577f98c6a38771ab335/TMessagesProj/src/main/res/values/strings.xml"}},{"locale":"ta","script":"Taml","concept":"billing.stop_renewal","role":"button","text":"தானியங்கி புதுப்பிப்பை நிறுத்து","status":"draft","note":"Unreviewed draft for stopping future automatic renewal while access continues until the paid period ends. Do not use it for dialog Cancel or for ending access today. Not source-attested.","source":{"id":"reference-only","url":"https://github.com/DrKLO/Telegram/blob/21f7d109da6ab3506c9e9577f98c6a38771ab335/TMessagesProj/src/main/res/values/strings.xml"}},{"locale":"ta","script":"Taml","concept":"billing.pay_now","role":"button","text":"இப்போது செலுத்து","status":"draft","note":"Unreviewed draft for submitting payment at this step. It is not the button that only opens the payment screen. Not source-attested.","source":{"id":"reference-only","url":"https://github.com/DrKLO/Telegram/blob/21f7d109da6ab3506c9e9577f98c6a38771ab335/TMessagesProj/src/main/res/values/strings.xml"}},{"locale":"ta","script":"Taml","concept":"billing.go_to_payment","role":"button","text":"கட்டணத்திற்குச் செல்","status":"draft","note":"Unreviewed draft. Not source-attested and not a native-speaker review. Opens the payment step. It does not charge the user.","source":{"id":"reference-only","url":"https://github.com/Kamaleshkabeerdoss/nativeskill/blob/main/skills/nativeskill/assets/concepts.json"}},{"locale":"ta","script":"Taml","concept":"billing.payment_declined","role":"status","text":"கட்டணம் நிராகரிக்கப்பட்டது","status":"draft","note":"Unreviewed draft. Not source-attested and not a native-speaker review. The provider declined the payment. Do not invent a reason.","source":{"id":"reference-only","url":"https://github.com/Kamaleshkabeerdoss/nativeskill/blob/main/skills/nativeskill/assets/concepts.json"}},{"locale":"ta","script":"Taml","concept":"billing.retry_payment","role":"button","text":"கட்டணத்தை மீண்டும் முயல்க","status":"draft","note":"Unreviewed draft. Not source-attested and not a native-speaker review. Starts another payment attempt. It does not say the previous charge failed unless the screen already says that.","source":{"id":"reference-only","url":"https://github.com/Kamaleshkabeerdoss/nativeskill/blob/main/skills/nativeskill/assets/concepts.json"}},{"locale":"ta","script":"Taml","concept":"billing.cancel_payment","role":"button","text":"இந்தக் கட்டணத்தை ரத்துசெய்","status":"draft","note":"Unreviewed draft. Not source-attested and not a native-speaker review. Cancels this payment attempt. It does not stop later renewals.","source":{"id":"reference-only","url":"https://github.com/Kamaleshkabeerdoss/nativeskill/blob/main/skills/nativeskill/assets/concepts.json"}},{"locale":"ta","script":"Taml","concept":"billing.end_subscription_now","role":"button","text":"சந்தாவை இப்போது முடி","status":"draft","note":"Unreviewed draft. Not source-attested and not a native-speaker review. Ends access now. Does not promise a refund.","source":{"id":"reference-only","url":"https://github.com/Kamaleshkabeerdoss/nativeskill/blob/main/skills/nativeskill/assets/concepts.json"}},{"locale":"ta","script":"Taml","concept":"billing.refund_requested","role":"status","text":"பணத்திரும்பப் பெறும் கோரிக்கை பதிவாகியது","status":"draft","note":"Unreviewed draft. Not source-attested and not a native-speaker review. The request is recorded. The money is not necessarily back.","source":{"id":"reference-only","url":"https://github.com/Kamaleshkabeerdoss/nativeskill/blob/main/skills/nativeskill/assets/concepts.json"}},{"locale":"ta","script":"Taml","concept":"billing.refund_completed","role":"status","text":"பணம் திருப்பியளிக்கப்பட்டது","status":"draft","note":"Unreviewed draft. Not source-attested and not a native-speaker review. The refund has completed. Keep the amount and destination when the app provides them.","source":{"id":"reference-only","url":"https://github.com/Kamaleshkabeerdoss/nativeskill/blob/main/skills/nativeskill/assets/concepts.json"}},{"locale":"ta","script":"Taml","concept":"billing.payment_pending","role":"status","text":"கட்டணம் இன்னும் முடியவில்லை","status":"draft","note":"Unreviewed draft. Not source-attested and not a native-speaker review. No final outcome. Do not imply success or failure.","source":{"id":"reference-only","url":"https://github.com/Kamaleshkabeerdoss/nativeskill/blob/main/skills/nativeskill/assets/concepts.json"}},{"locale":"ta","script":"Taml","concept":"auth.resend_code","role":"button","text":"குறியீட்டை மீண்டும் அனுப்பு","status":"draft","note":"Unreviewed draft. Not source-attested and not a native-speaker review. Sends another code. Does not say the previous code still works.","source":{"id":"reference-only","url":"https://github.com/Kamaleshkabeerdoss/nativeskill/blob/main/skills/nativeskill/assets/concepts.json"}},{"locale":"ta","script":"Taml","concept":"auth.code_expired","role":"status","text":"இந்தக் குறியீடு காலாவதியானது","status":"draft","note":"Unreviewed draft. Not source-attested and not a native-speaker review. The code expired. That is different from a wrong code.","source":{"id":"reference-only","url":"https://github.com/Kamaleshkabeerdoss/nativeskill/blob/main/skills/nativeskill/assets/concepts.json"}},{"locale":"ta","script":"Taml","concept":"form.save_draft","role":"button","text":"வரைவைச் சேமி","status":"draft","note":"Unreviewed draft. Not source-attested and not a native-speaker review. Short button. The work stays unpublished.","source":{"id":"reference-only","url":"https://github.com/Kamaleshkabeerdoss/nativeskill/blob/main/skills/nativeskill/assets/concepts.json"}},{"locale":"ta","script":"Taml","concept":"form.discard_changes","role":"button","text":"மாற்றங்களை கைவிடு","status":"draft","note":"Unreviewed draft. Not source-attested and not a native-speaker review. Drops unsaved edits only.","source":{"id":"reference-only","url":"https://github.com/Kamaleshkabeerdoss/nativeskill/blob/main/skills/nativeskill/assets/concepts.json"}},{"locale":"ta","script":"Taml","concept":"item.delete_permanently","role":"button","text":"நிரந்தரமாக நீக்கு","status":"draft","note":"Unreviewed draft. Not source-attested and not a native-speaker review. Irreversible deletion. Not archive.","source":{"id":"reference-only","url":"https://github.com/Kamaleshkabeerdoss/nativeskill/blob/main/skills/nativeskill/assets/concepts.json"}},{"locale":"ta","script":"Taml","concept":"item.archive","role":"button","text":"காப்பகப்படுத்து","status":"draft","note":"Unreviewed draft. Not source-attested and not a native-speaker review. Android Tamil archive is காப்பிடு, which means copy. Do not reuse it.","source":{"id":"reference-only","url":"https://github.com/Kamaleshkabeerdoss/nativeskill/blob/main/skills/nativeskill/assets/concepts.json"}},{"locale":"ta","script":"Taml","concept":"content.download","role":"button","text":"பதிவிறக்கு","status":"draft","note":"Unreviewed draft. Not source-attested and not a native-speaker review. Download onto the device. Not upload.","source":{"id":"reference-only","url":"https://github.com/Kamaleshkabeerdoss/nativeskill/blob/main/skills/nativeskill/assets/concepts.json"}},{"locale":"ta","script":"Taml","concept":"search.clear_filters","role":"button","text":"வடிகட்டிகளை அழி","status":"draft","note":"Unreviewed draft. Not source-attested and not a native-speaker review. Clears filters. Does not delete items.","source":{"id":"reference-only","url":"https://github.com/Kamaleshkabeerdoss/nativeskill/blob/main/skills/nativeskill/assets/concepts.json"}},{"locale":"ta","script":"Taml","concept":"billing.discount_savings","role":"label","text":"{amount} சேமிப்பு","status":"draft","note":"Unreviewed draft. Not source-attested and not a native-speaker review. Keep {amount}. Not the Save button.","source":{"id":"reference-only","url":"https://github.com/Kamaleshkabeerdoss/nativeskill/blob/main/skills/nativeskill/assets/concepts.json"}},{"locale":"ta","script":"Taml","concept":"item.add","role":"button","text":"சேர்","status":"draft","note":"Unreviewed draft. Not source-attested and not a native-speaker review. Adds to the current collection.","source":{"id":"reference-only","url":"https://github.com/Kamaleshkabeerdoss/nativeskill/blob/main/skills/nativeskill/assets/concepts.json"}},{"locale":"ta","script":"Taml","concept":"auth.verify_email","role":"button","text":"மின்னஞ்சலை உறுதிசெய்","status":"draft","note":"Unreviewed draft. Not source-attested and not a native-speaker review. Core UI draft for the style-guide locale.","source":{"id":"reference-only","url":"https://github.com/Kamaleshkabeerdoss/nativeskill/blob/main/skills/nativeskill/assets/concepts.json"}},{"locale":"ta","script":"Taml","concept":"auth.session_expired","role":"status","text":"அமர்வு முடிந்தது. தொடர மீண்டும் உள்நுழையவும்.","status":"draft","note":"Unreviewed draft. Not source-attested and not a native-speaker review. Core UI draft for the style-guide locale.","source":{"id":"reference-only","url":"https://github.com/Kamaleshkabeerdoss/nativeskill/blob/main/skills/nativeskill/assets/concepts.json"}},{"locale":"ta","script":"Taml","concept":"auth.sign_in","role":"button","text":"உள்நுழை","status":"draft","note":"Preferred Sign in (draft). உள்ளே போ means go inside.","source":{"id":"reference-only","url":"https://github.com/Kamaleshkabeerdoss/nativeskill/blob/main/skills/nativeskill/assets/concepts.json"},"preferred":true}]},"references":[{"id":"iana","kind":"language-tags","url":"https://www.iana.org/assignments/language-subtag-registry/language-subtag-registry"},{"id":"cldr-likely","kind":"script-and-region","url":"https://github.com/unicode-org/cldr-json/blob/49.0.0/cldr-json/cldr-core/supplemental/likelySubtags.json"},{"id":"cldr-scripts","kind":"script-direction","url":"https://github.com/unicode-org/cldr-json/blob/49.0.0/cldr-json/cldr-core/scriptMetadata.json"},{"id":"cldr-plurals","kind":"cardinal-plurals","url":"https://github.com/unicode-org/cldr-json/blob/49.0.0/cldr-json/cldr-core/supplemental/plurals.json"},{"id":"cldr-ordinals","kind":"ordinal-plurals","url":"https://github.com/unicode-org/cldr-json/blob/49.0.0/cldr-json/cldr-core/supplemental/ordinals.json"},{"id":"cldr-ta","kind":"locale-data","url":"https://github.com/unicode-org/cldr/blob/release-49/common/main/ta.xml"},{"id":"kaikki-ta","kind":"descriptive-dictionary","scope":"ta","url":"https://kaikki.org/dictionary/Tamil/index.html"}]}
